Description: A fork of 'simulist' that adds an agent-based outbreak model
    built on 'individual', with households, finite populations that
    deplete, mobility between locations and location-level interventions.
    Line lists and contacts have the same structure as 'simulist', so its
    tools to make data messy, right-truncate and censor apply unchanged.
    The branching process simulation of 'simulist' is kept, with a
    spatial extension.
